    {
      "id": "ember_tenn_ring_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He fetches a bored core without being asked. “Forty. In eleven years of wood.” He turns it. “And they run the wrong way out from the middle, which I have shown to three foresters and one of them walked off.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_trees_ring"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_tenn_ring_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_tenn_ring_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_vent_readers",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_tenn_ring_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_tenn_posts_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Not milestones. Wrong spacing, wrong iron.” He draws it in the dirt with a stick: four posts, and a shape between them. “They are corners. And the middle of what they are the corners of is under the new trees.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_trees_posts"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_tenn_posts_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_tenn_posts_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_vent_readers",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_tenn_posts_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_tenn_sealed_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Cannot be. It is barred.” He is very clear about this. “Barred from the inside, and the adit is the only way in, and I would like somebody cleverer than me to explain how both of those are true.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_trees_sealed"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
